---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'Prepare for China — Entry & Setup Guide';
const description = 'Everything to prepare before your trip to China.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="th">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-10 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-2">✅ Prepare</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-3 leading-tight">Prepare for Your China Trip</h1>
      <p class="text-base text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Everything to prepare before your trip to China.</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Stats -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-12 not-prose">
      <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-green-800">5</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-green-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">วีซ่าและการเข้าเมือง</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-blue-800">1</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">Digital Setup</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-amber-800">4</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">Before You Fly</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Category Sections -->
    <div class="space-y-8 mb-16 not-prose">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-green-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-green-800">วีซ่าและการเข้าเมือง</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-green-800 opacity-60">5 articles</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/th/visa/visa-guide/" class="block bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-green-800">📖 Overview</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">China Visa Types Complete Guide</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">อธิบายตัวเลือกวีซ่าทั้งหมด — เปรียบเทียบการยกเว้นวีซ่า การผ่านเมืองและวีซ่า L</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/th/visa/visa-free/" class="block bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-green-800">📋 List</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">รายชื่อประเทศที่ได้รับการยกเว้นวีซ่าจีน</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">50 countries can enter without a visa สูงสุด 30 วัน.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/th/visa/transit-240/" class="block bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-green-800">✈️ Transit</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">240-Hour Visa-Free Transit</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">55 eligible countries — stay up to 10 days without a visa.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/th/visa/mutual-agreement/" class="block bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-green-800">🤝 Mutual</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">ข้อตกลงยกเว้นวีซ่าร่วมกัน</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">29 countries have reciprocal visa-free deals with China.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/th/visa/apply-l-visa/" class="block bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-green-800">📝 Application</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">วิธีขอวีซ่าท่องเที่ยวจีน</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">Step-by-step guide — documents, COVA form, fees, and tips.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-blue-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-blue-800">Digital Setup</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-blue-800 opacity-60">1 article</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/th/life/sim-card-guide/" class="block bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-800">📶 Internet</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">Best SIM Card & eSIM for Tourists</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">Compare eSIM providers, airport SIM cards, and data plans.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-amber-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-800">Before You Fly</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-amber-800 opacity-60">4 articles</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/th/visa/customs-guide/" class="block bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-800">🛃 Regulations</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">China ข้อบังคับศุลกากร</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">Duty-free limits, prohibited items, and what to declare.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/th/visa/arrival-card/" class="block bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-800">📄 บัตรขาเข้า</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">Submit Your บัตรขาเข้า Online</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">Fill in the NIA arrival card before you fly — step by step with screenshots.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/th/life/survival-kit/" class="block bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-800">🎒 Checklist</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">Your China Trip Survival Kit</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">Full pre-departure checklist — documents, apps, and what to pack.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/th/visa/first-time-china/" class="block bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-800">🌟 First Time</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">ครั้งแรกในจีน</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">ไทม์ไลน์ฉบับสมบูรณ์ — วีซ่า การเตรียมตัวดิจิทัล แพ็คกระเป๋า การมาถึง 24 ชั่วโมงแรก</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- คู่มือที่เกี่ยวข้อง -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-5">คู่มือที่เกี่ยวข้อง</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <a href="/th/payment/payment-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100 no-underline">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-0.5">การชำระเงินในจีน</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Set up Alipay and more</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/th/transport/transport-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100 no-underline">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-0.5">การเดินทางในจีน</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Getting around</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>